    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Rejection Vulnerability",
      "category": "defensive",
      "text": "Areelu Vorlesh's apotheosis into a demon has made her vulnerable to rejection like a succubus. When Areelu fails a Deception check to Embrace or Lie, or when a creature succeeds at its save against her mental spells or abilities, she takes 6d6 mental damage. For 1 hour after causing mental damage to Areelu in this way, the creature can deal 6d6 mental damage to her with a successful Demoralize action incorporating its rejection."
    },
