      "text": "Frequency once per round\n\n---\nEffect Areelu engages a creature she has Grabbed or Restrained in an embrace or other act of passion, creating an opportunity for a cloud of locusts to enter the creature's body. The creature takes 5d6 persistent,bleed damage and is Sickened 2 and Off-Guard for as long as they remain sickened."
